### Base URL variable
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Root route
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. GET all books
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books

### 3. Filter books by author (case-insensitive: 'kalam')
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/filter?author=kalam

### 4. Filter books by author (no match -> empty array)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/filter?author=Shakespeare

### 5. GET book by ID (Valid)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/101

### 6. GET book by ID (Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/999

### 7. POST a new book (Valid sample from exam)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Discovery of India",
  "author": "Jawaharlal Nehru",
  "genre": "History",
  "publishedYear": 1946,
  "available": true
}

### 8. POST a new book (Invalid - missing fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Incomplete Book"
}

### 9. PUT update a book (Valid update from exam)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/102
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Alchemist - Revised Edition",
  "author": "Paulo Coelho",
  "genre": "Fiction",
  "publishedYear": 1988,
  "available": true
}

### 10. PUT update non-existent book
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost Book"
}

### 11. DELETE a book (Valid)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/103

### 12. DELETE non-existent book
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/999
